<title>USA: CorVel files for ENStar to resell shares.</title>
<headline>CorVel files for ENStar to resell shares.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>CorVel Corp said it filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for ENStar Inc to resell up to 200,000 shares of CorVel common stock.</p>
<p>ENStar is a unit of North Star Universal Inc.</p>
</text>
